  "description": "Chuu, a bright and food-loving child who grew up in an orphanage, dreams of owning a pastry shop. One day, she is suddenly chosen as an awakened candidate and adopted into the prestigious Pasayen family as Superty Pasayen. While adjusting to her new life, she is invited to join a strange childcare variety show system where completing quirky quests from Spirit Kings makes her stronger. As she navigates her unfamiliar family, odd missions, and overly invested spirits, Superty embarks on a heartwarming and chaotic journey of growth—saving the world with cuteness.\n\nSource: MU",
